graph INTENT_SCOPE 1
entry INTENT-001

gate INTENT-001
context TASK_START
question "Does the admitted task state one intended outcome, one owner, and explicit non-goals?"
evidence intent,owner,non_goals
YES INTENT-002
NO SOFT-REVIEW
UNKNOWN UNPROVEN
NOT_APPLICABLE HARD-STOP-SCOPE
end

gate INTENT-002
context CODE_CHANGE
question "Does the proposed change remain inside the recorded scope and hard and soft boundaries?"
evidence scope,boundaries,changed_paths
YES INTENT-003
NO HARD-STOP-SCOPE
UNKNOWN UNPROVEN
NOT_APPLICABLE HARD-STOP-SCOPE
end

gate INTENT-003
context CODE_CHANGE
question "At this checkpoint, does the result still serve the owner's intended outcome without silently adding a new objective?"
evidence intent,changed_scope,conflicts
YES INTENT-004
NO HARD-STOP-SCOPE
UNKNOWN UNPROVEN
NOT_APPLICABLE HARD-STOP-SCOPE
end

gate INTENT-004
context HANDOFF
question "If scope, intent, or conditions changed, was the current goal closed or reassessed before more work was allowed?"
evidence reassessment,replacement,goal_change
YES COMPLETE
NO HARD-STOP-SCOPE
UNKNOWN UNPROVEN
NOT_APPLICABLE HARD-STOP-SCOPE
end

terminal COMPLETE COMPLETE "The intent and scope are explicit and unchanged."
terminal HARD-STOP-SCOPE HARD_STOP "The work cannot continue outside its admitted intent or scope."
terminal SOFT-REVIEW SOFT_REVIEW "The Campaign Orchestrator must review the intent or scope."
terminal UNPROVEN UNPROVEN "The intent or scope needs evidence before work continues."
